# What the working tree carries besides the document's output.
#
# Matching here means *protect*: every file under --out must be produced by a
# #file declaration or listed in a .lpignore, and this file lists what lp does
# not manage (ADR D10). The repository root is the output directory, so this is
# the list of the repository's handwritten assets.

/.git
/.gitignore
/.lpmap.json
/.pi
/AGENTS.md
/Cargo.lock
/README.md
/agent-notes
/bootstrap
/examples
/experiments
/flake.lock
/flake.nix
/lit
/result
/self.typ
/target
